L001161	This result corresponds to the long-time linear growth of holographic complexity in classical black hole geometries. Quantum corrections arise from the remaining contributions in the generating function, which correspond to Euclidean wormholes. By applying the regularization procedure as discussed previously for the $\alpha_\pm \to 0$ limit, we obtain
