L001208	First, let us first focus on the classical regime, where holographic complexity grows linearly up to timescales of order $t \sim e^{S_0} \to \infty$. In this limit, holographic complexity is captured entirely by the disconnected part of the spectral correlator. To probe this regime, we can take the classical limit which yields
